@startuml uc_03_assign_patient
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title F3 Assign a patient through the hotspot (REQ-11, REQ-12)
start
:Operator long-presses the button (at least 2 s) while idle;
:Device opens a password-protected hotspot;
:Operator connects with a phone and opens the page;
if (Patient chosen and confirmed?) then (yes)
 :Device stores the patient on the FHIR server;
 if (Stored and read back correctly?) then (yes)
  :Later results go to this patient;
 else (no)
  :Device stays unassigned and shows error;
 endif
else (cancel or timeout)
 :No change;
endif
:Device closes the hotspot and rejoins Wi-Fi;
stop
@enduml
